    {
      "index": 0,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Hi! Here's your cake. Is everything okay?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Sorry, I think there's a problem. I ordered a chocolate cake, and this one is vanilla. Also, the name is wrong. It says Nona, not Mona."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Oh no, I'm really sorry. I can change the name on this one right now. It only takes five minutes."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Thanks, but she really wants chocolate. It's her favorite. Do you have a chocolate cake I could take today?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "We have a chocolate cake ready in the fridge, but there's no writing on it yet. Writing the name would take about fifteen minutes."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "The party starts in fifty minutes, and it takes thirty minutes to get there. So fifteen minutes is okay. Is it the same size?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Yes, same size and same price, so there's nothing extra to pay."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Great, I'll take the chocolate cake, please. Can you check the spelling this time? M-O-N-A."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Of course. Chocolate cake, \"Happy Birthday, Mona\", ready in fifteen minutes."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Perfect, thank you. I'll wait here."
    }
  ],
